## Operational notes

- topK=5 is tight for multi-clause questions — production guru prompts asking
  compound questions should consider topK 8–10 (design note for spec 9 / embed-door
  amendment; cost impact nil at AOSS floor).
- Grounding-corpus granularity MUST match the citation granularity users need —
  corpus docs at clause-family level cap citation precision (run-1 lesson,
  applies to tenant onboarding guidance: chunk uploaded standards at sub-clause level).
